# Cline & Roo Code Rules for cooliebase-all
# The authoritative rules for this project live in `.agents/rules/`, `AGENTS.md`, and `HARNESS.md`.

- Core Directives: `.agents/rules/RULE-0-UNIVERSAL-DIRECTIVES.md`
- High-Order Inverse Thinking: `.agents/rules/HIGH-ORDER-INVERSE-THINKING.md`
- Engineering Deliverables: `.agents/rules/SPEC-FIRST-ENGINEERING-ARTIFACTS.md`
- Spec & Prototype Standard: `.agents/rules/FEATURE-SPEC-AND-PROTOTYPE-STANDARD.md`
- Two-Pillar Architecture:
  - Project PMO Radar (First Step on Open): `pnpm run pmo` / `node scripts/cmmi-01-management.cjs pmo` (`docs/01_management/pmo-dashboard.md`)
  - Pillar 1 (`harness` = Master Workflow): `pnpm harness <install|check|build|start|health|status|stop|e2e|deliver|pmo>` (`scripts/harness.cjs`)
  - Pillar 2 (`speckit` + CMMI 00~09 Stage Document Extensions): `pnpm run speckit -- cmmi <00..09> [docs|check|asset|pmo|...]` (`scripts/cmmi-00-meta.cjs` ~ `scripts/cmmi-09-operations.cjs`)
- `<500 Tokens` Blueprint + Embedded PostgreSQL 18.4 E2E: `pnpm run blueprint:deliver -- --file <domain>.blueprint.json --verify-e2e`
- Spec Commands: `pnpm run spec:new`, `pnpm run spec:build`, `pnpm run spec:check`, `pnpm run spec:archive`
- Project Initialization: `.agents/rules/PROJECT-INIT-AND-REFACTOR.md`
- Multi-Tenant Isolation: `.agents/rules/MULTI-TENANT-ISOLATION.md`
- Engineering Gates: `AGENTS.md`

## 第一步（强制）：需求分诊

动手做任何需求之前，先跑：

    pnpm run agent:route -- "<用户的原始需求原文>"

它会给出**确定性判定**，而不是靠模型自行揣测：

- `SPEC_REQUIRED` → 先 `pnpm run speckit:new -- --name <名> --domain <域> --type <类型> --title "<标题>"`
- `DIRECT_OK` → 可直接改（改完仍须 `pnpm run check` 全绿）
- `NOT_A_REQUIREMENT` → 这句话不是一个需求（确认 / 授权 / 上下文陈述 / 调研提问 / 续作指令），既不立规格也不改代码

它同时把用户原始输入记入 `docs/features/sprint-prod/{MMDD}.md`（AGENTS §15）。
判定规则真源：`scripts/lib/spec-necessity-rules.cjs` —— 规则表可审阅、可修改；
**认为判错了就改规则表**（并跑 `test/unit/agent-route.test.ts`），而不是绕过它。
